Description: PANMOX terminal for PMX OS — transparent, blue, blurry
 MoxTerminal is a terminal emulator built on GTK 3 and VTE, designed for
 PMX OS and Debian. It is translucent and blurry by default and ships the
 two PANMOX looks: deep-cyan (the modern default) and retro phosphor-green.
 .
 Features:
  * True transparency with KDE blur-behind (KWin / X11)
  * Tabs, font zoom, URL detection, hand-editable INI config
  * 256-color + true-color, configurable shell, scrollback and cursor
 .
 No cloud. No telemetry. No boss.
